window.products.push({"id":502113,"name":"FIVETAS cutting boards for kitchen dishwasher safe,set of 3 with holder,plastic cutting boards with Easy-Grip Handles.GARLIC GRINDING AREA. BPA Free, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Etn1-enpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Simplify Your Life]Double sided design,clean and economy.Cutting board with non-slip is good for cutting meat,turkey,steak,in the other side,it’s best choice for cutting fruit,vegetables etc.Besides,there is garlic grinding area - convenient milling zone for garlic/ginger grinding that saves time and energy.If you want to measure the food size,there is centimetre and you can cut the length of food which you want. [Own Distinctive Design style]The protruding part on the edge of the cutting board can prevent juices from spilling out of the table and ensure that the table is clean.The durable stainless steel handle with high temperatures and anti-corrosion.Especially our cutting board is Morandi color system which is different from ordinary board.Compared with other conventional cutting board,our exquisite chopping board Set is in the line with the current fashion trend.It makes your kitchen more beautiful. [Unique Cutting Board Set]FIVETAS Kitchen Cutting Board is made from non porous plastic that ultra durable and highly resistant to heat.The plastic cutting boards for kitchen contain no BPA and no sharp corners,it’s safe for your family.Cutting boards set is very exquisite.There are 3 sizes for this chopping boards which almost fit for all your Cutting needs..The set included a support frame which is made from plastic and 2cr-13 stainless steel with durable and non-slip . [Washing Safe]Chopping Boards can be wash by water or dis-washing machine. There are no odor after washing the cutting board.Unlike wood or bamboo, these nonporous boards are easy to clean, simply throw in the dishwasher as needed; won’t splinter, crack or peel, even after many washes; no oiling or maintenance necessary. [Nice Gift]A practical cutting board is not only a great kitchen helper, but also a great gift.It must be a satisfactory gift for family,friends,neighbour in the festival.Besides,Our cutting boards are exquisite and can be taken to picnics and barbecues in outdoor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Etn1-enpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FIVETAS","source_asin":"B0C6J4QY6X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-502113","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6J4QY6X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6J4QY6X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
