window.products.push({"id":502216,"name":"Franco Kids Bedding Super Soft Microfiber Comforter, Twin, Pokemon Pikachu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fpQV+wQkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"After a long day of catching poké balls, your little gamer will be ready to climb into bed and wrap himself in this soft microfiber comforter. With Pikachu by his side, he’ll wake up recharged and animated for the day. The kids’ comforter offers super soft comfort that will lull them to sleep with its soft microfiber material. Pikachu, Ivy Saur, Squirtle and Charmander are poised to leap from the front of this soft microfiber comforter with large, vibrant character artwork that young gamers will love. When he’s ready for the next level, he can switch up the look of his room by flipping over this reversible comforter to reveal an all-over character logo print on a white background.A great way to add some color and excitement to their bedroom, this Pokémon twin comforter will supercharge their bed with comfort and fun.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fpQV+wQkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Franco","source_asin":"B0743F4M26","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-502216","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0743F4M26","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0743F4M26","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
