window.products.push({"id":502236,"name":"Taimei Teatime Ceramic Tea Mug with Infuser and Lid, 15.5 oz Tea Infuser Mug with Large Strainer for Steeping Loose Leaf Tea, Women Man Office Home Gi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7114FT4QU+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Convenient and Safe - This 15.5-ounce teacup is lead and cadmium free, making it safe for daily use at home or in the office. It's also dishwasher and microwave safe for added convenience. Efficient Strainer - The sturdy food-grade stainless steel strainer with extra-fine holes allows for simple and quick tea brewing. The filter can be easily removed and is dishwasher safe. Versatile Lid - The multi-function lid not only keeps your tea or coffee hot and flavorful for longer, but also serves as a coaster to hold the infuser after brewing. It seals your teacup, allowing the flavor to fully extract from the tea leaves and giving you the purest taste. Unique Gift - With its hand-painted floral design and the sweet message, \"You Are My Sunshine My Only Sunshine,\" this teacup is a perfect gift for tea lovers, housewarmings, weddings, and holidays. Guarantee - Taimei is committed to providing high-quality tea and coffee sets. If you have any questions about our products, please contact us, and we'll be happy to help you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7114FT4QU+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Taimei Teatime","source_asin":"B0BS6JVZPT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-502236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS6JVZPT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS6JVZPT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":502237,"name":"Celine Linen Luxury Super-Soft Coziest 1500 Thread Count Egyptian Quality 2-Piece Greek Embroidered Duvet Cover Set, (Insert Comforter Protector) Wrin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PTQYg2wrS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Experience luxury like you've never felt before with these silky soft duvet covers that feel almost hedonistic, this sumptuous set is going to bring your dreams to a whole new level. Slip between the covers and let yourself wallow in the decadence that this bedding offers. Add in delightfully soft, ultra-plush shams (pillowcases), and you'll truly feel pampered. This 2-piece set is crafted from incredible, wrinkle-free 100 GSM microfiber and features an Elegant Greek Design Embroidery on a Duvet Cover and Shams. It's available in a variety of beautiful colors, and no matter which one you choose, when morning comes, and the alarm clock goes off, you just might be tempted to crawl farther beneath these covers and try to pick up where your dreams left off. Care Instructions: Machine wash Cold, Gentle Cycle. Do not bleach. Tumble dry low. Iron as needed- Celine Linen","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PTQYg2wrS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CELINE LINEN","source_asin":"B07HCTG3HS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-502237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HCTG3HS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HCTG3HS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":502238,"name":"Faux Fur 12-volt/110-volt Heated Throw by Trillium Worldwide Model FF-900 Silver and Gray 58\" x 36\", 1 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":111.11,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ALRtYaU5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This luxurious faux fur heated throw, which reverses to a plush fleece, is ideal for cold winter travel keeping passengers comfy and warm. It's also perfect for snuggling up in your favorite chair at home or at the cabin. Simply plug the Faux Fur Cozy into any vehicle 12-volt power outlet (or the included 110-volt adapter) and in just minutes, you'll experience the radiant warmth and comfort of this ultra-soft heated throw. It measures a generous 58\" x 36\" and features a 60 minute patented safety timer, an on/off switch, automatic temperature control, a reset button, and a 7' long cord with fused plug. LED's on both the plug and the timer control switch indicate that the throw is on. The throw provides warmth whether it's plugged in or not. It makes a great gift and safety product for winter travel. Faux fur and fleece material are 100% polyester. Dimensions: 58\" x 36\" x 2\" Voltage: 12 volts Wattage: 40 watts Amp Draw: 3.3 amps. The 110-volt adapter is UL approved. 90 Day Limited Warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ALRtYaU5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Faux Fur Cozy","source_asin":"B019EHJIIY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-502238","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019EHJIIY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019EHJIIY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":502239,"name":"Eloab 5-Piece Card Table Set, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mhoQ9zQXL._AC_SL1289_.jpg","description":"Provide extra seating for your family and friends with the 5-Piece Card Table Set. It's perfect for parties or occasions where a dining table set is needed. This black card table set is big enough for four people to play games, make crafts or share a meal. The sleek black exterior will complement virtually any home decor, and the chairs tuck neatly under the card table for extra room. The chairs feature vinyl upholstered seats and the top of the folding card table is made out of PVC, making this set very easy to clean. Plus, you won't need to worry about clutter - this card table and chair set folds up neatly for space-saving storage. It is perfect for offices, rec rooms, small apartments and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mhoQ9zQXL._AC_SL1289_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eloab","source_asin":"B0B5TFTB8D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-502239","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5TFTB8D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5TFTB8D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
