window.products.push({"id":502371,"name":"Pasta Maker Stand Attachment for Kitchenaid Mixer - 3 in 1 Set Includes Pasta Sheet Roller Spaghetti Cutter Fettuccine Cutter Maker Assecories and Cle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W5q7nU9UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✨【3-in-1 Upgrade Design】This 3-in-1 Pasta Maker Attachment fits ALL KitchenAid Stand Mixer perfectly. Truly realized three functions in one-Pasta Sheet Roller/Spaghetti Cutter/Fettuccine Cutter. Simply attach it to the power hub of any KitchenAid stand mixer. Roll the dough and cut the pasta into spaghetti Fettuccine, and lasagna at the same time, no need to change pasta attachment. ✨【Well Made & Sturdy】3 sets of blades are refined from grade SUS304 stainless steel, including 3 internal shafts and gears. Uniform power transmission makes sure presents perfect pasta. The protective case is a build-in POM. The overall structure is beautiful, sturdy, small. It has only 1.7KG is convenient for storage. It is also a must-have accessory for KitchenAid. ✨【8 Thickness Settings】Stainless steel rollers and cutters for consistent smooth rolling and clean cutting of pasta dough. Easily roll 5.5-inch sheets of fresh pasta, with 8 thickness settings, to achieve your desired sheet thickness. Generally recommended setting 5 or 4. ✨【Easy to Use & Clean】Enjoy making handmade pasta fun! Remove plastic hatch exposing the rollers and cutters and clean inside with the brush included. Note: Dishwasher Disable. Do not soak in water for a long time. ✨【Time-Saver & Convenient】Pasta Roller rolls 5.5-inch sheets of pasta with 8 different thickness options. You don't need to disassemble and replace other dough mixers. The advantage of this design is that you can complete 3 steps at the same time. For various recipes: Ravioli, Tortellini, Dumplings, Empanada, Lasagna, Noodles, sheets of Wonton, Dumplings, TACO, classic Spaghetti noodles, Fettuccine noodles, etc. 🎁【Excellent Gift Choice】It's a great gift for people who already have KitchenAid Stand Mixer. For people who love to cook and this was a great accessory to their KitchenAid, Ideal gift for Mother's Day, Father's Day, Thanksgiving, Christmas, New Year.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W5q7nU9UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VNYIFAN","source_asin":"B09XQBFMDB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-502371","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XQBFMDB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XQBFMDB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
