window.products.push({"id":502437,"name":"Rolanstar End Table with Charging Station, Narrow Nightstand, Flip Top Side Table with USB Ports and Storage Shelves, End Tables Living Room Set of 2 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bt89ZfuHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[End Table with Charging Station] To easily charge your phone, tablet and laptop, Rolanstar end table has built-in charging station that contains 2 standard outlets and 2 USB ports. You can move the end table easily with the help of 6.5ft long power supply cord. With the help of half circle openings on the side of the practical couch table, you can charge your essentials within the reach of sofa or bed. [Versatile and Convenient End Table] For storage purpose, the narrow side table contains a drawer and 2 wooden shelves which provides ample of space. You can also place your decorative phone lamps books and many more things on vintage wooden shelf which is there for open display. For concealed storage, there is flip top drawer. The fully expandable flip top plate of the drawer makes it convenient and makes the table a great choice for living room, bedroom, home office and small spaces. [Fit in Small Spaces] The table is used for various purposes like organizing remotes, laptops, phones, books next to the couch, chair, recliner etc. It can be fit into the narrow space on the both sides of sofa and also great for bed as the nightstands. The dimension of the shelf is 23.6 inches in x Length 11.8 inches in Width x 23.6 inches in Height. [Sturdy and Decorative Construction] This bedside table has retro rustic black display which fits with any decor and add warm charming element to your room. The table has a sturdy structure as it is constructed with particle board with rigid metal frame which offers durability and stability. With bearing capacity up to 22 lbs. [Easy to Assemble and Clean] Melamine veneer tabletop can be cleaned with the help of a damp cloth. It is waterproof and heat-resistant and dustproof. The end table package includes all necessary hardware, clear and detailed instruction. It includes all the labeled parts. It can be easily assembled within 30 minutes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bt89ZfuHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rolanstar","source_asin":"B09292K2C7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-502437","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09292K2C7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09292K2C7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
