window.products.push({"id":502584,"name":"Lekue Spanish Omelet/Frittata Maker, Model #","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G9r2IO96L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fall in love with healthy, easy cooking with the most innovative products thanks to Lekue. Quality, functionality and design that will surprise you with a wide range of tools to make cooking, preparation, preservation, baking and freezing easier. With this Spanish Omelet, Lekue provides practical and revolutionary solutions for today's society way of cooking. Spanish omelet is a mold designed to cook round shaped dishes required two sided cooking, making the process more comfortable and easier than ever. Have delicious Spanish omelets, frittatas and much more, in the microwave. 1) Add the ingredients to the Spanish omelet mold 2) Close and cook in the microwave. Note that the time and power level may vary depending on the microwave. To transport, hold the mold by the handles and gently pull outwards. 3) Without opening it, press down on the top of the Spanish omelet to remove the air and turn over using the handles. 4) Cook in the microwave again for the time specified by the recipe. 5) Remove from microwave. When opening, be careful not to burn yourself with the steam inside. Serve. Recommendations: wash the product before its first use. Microwave, oven and dishwasher safe. Do not use the product directly over an open flame or heat source. To un-mold easily, lightly grease the mold on first uses. Allow to cool for a few seconds after cooking. Do not use the grill position in the microwave. When using a traditional over, place the mold in the lower part. Do not use scouring pads or abrasive soap for washing. Do not use sharp objects. Maximum capacity is 28 fluid ounces.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G9r2IO96L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lekue","source_asin":"B071JRT3N8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-502584","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071JRT3N8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071JRT3N8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":502585,"name":"CHIYI Water Heated Mattress Pad, Mattress Topper with Digital Temp. Control- 40 Heat Settings, Radiation-Free, No Electric Wire, Saving Energy, Timer ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l+bXGVwlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💖CHIYI Water Heated Mattress Topper——a New Experience of Healthy Sleep Characteristic： 👉①Pad Without Electrified Parts 👉②Radiation-Free 👉③No Drying Feeling 👉④Saving Water and Energy 👉⑤Water Shortage Alarm 👉⑥Constant temperature THE SIZE ABOUT WATER HEATED MATTRESS PAD: 👉Twin Size: 39\"X75\" 👉Queen Size: 60\"X80\" 👉King Size: 78\"X80\" Main Parameter: 👉Host Power: 235W 👉Host Body Power Supply: AC110V/60HZ 👉Host Body Noise: ≤30dB 👉Temperature Range: 20℃（68℉）-65℃（149℉） 👉Water Storage Volume: 1L PACKAGE CONTENTS: Constant Temperature Host×1  Mattress Pad ×1 User Manual×1 Remote Control×1 How to Use 💖①Remove the two nuts at the back of the host, Connect the silicone hose to the machine and blanket.💖②Turn on the power supply, inject clear water (about 500ml), wait for the water to enter the pad, the alarm will sound again, and then inject clear water again until the water level does not drop again. (if there is water shortage, it will give a prompt sound. In order to prevent minerals or accumulation from blocking the pipeline, it is recommended to use purified water)💖③one button “preheat” is recommended for areas with extremely cold weather.💖④Note: because the blanket is folded, it may be necessary to exhaust the air with the help of an exhaust funnel. 💖TIPS： ①About adding water：After the main engine is used for a long time, the liquid of water stage will be reduced, so pure water needs to be added. ②Place in the shade，do not place in the sun exposure for a long time. ③Contact us：If you have any questions, please contact us by e-mail, do not disassemble the machine yourself.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l+bXGVwlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"no band","source_asin":"B08KXQM21H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-502585","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KXQM21H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KXQM21H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
