window.products.push({"id":502644,"name":"Heat Resistant Mat for Air Fryer Anti-slip mat for kitchen appliances, 1 Pcs Kitchen Countertop Heat Protector Mat Kitchen Hot Pads for Ninja Foodi Ai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZRmWV9I2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When an air fryer is in the working mode it produces heat ( up to 570°F). If your Ninja air fryer has no foot stand then all the heat transfer to the kitchen countertop through the naked bottom of your Ninja Foodi air fryer. And can be a cause of cracking granite or marble countertop. This silicone air fryer heat-resistant pad can perfectly solve the heat problem of the air fryer.（Does not contain any home appliances） The kitchen appliance slide mat can help you easily move various small kitchen equipment such as coffee maker, Ninja Foodi air fryer, Kitchenaid stand mixer, bread machine from the storage corner to the edge of your operation. Kitchen Countertop Heat Protector Mats are especially suitable for marble or tile kitchen counters. The 1.7mm thick air fryer silicone pads are made of high-quality materials, effectively protecting your countertop from scratches. (Silicone ensures the stability and slip resistance of the machine, the silicone pad does not absorb water, has no peculiar smell and is convenient for cleaning) Compared with manual appliance sliding trays, this kitchen appliance organize mats are more flexible and more practical. You can choose according to the size of the bottom of the appliance, the maximum size of the silicone pad is 14inch*14inch. You can also tailor these appliance sliders according to the needs of machine base to make them look more beautiful. Compatible with Nijia, GoWISE, Ultrean small air fryer, coffee machine, pressure cooker, Kitchenaid blenders, stand mixers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZRmWV9I2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"mesadea","source_asin":"B0BNZCKT3Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-502644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNZCKT3Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNZCKT3Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":502645,"name":"mDesign Metal Wire Tub & Shower Caddy, Hanging Storage Organizer Center with Built-In Hooks and Baskets on 2 Levels for Shampoo, Body Wash, Loofahs - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51F7Ih0TTXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"STORAGE MADE SIMPLE: Keep shower essentials close at hand with this convenient shower and bathtub caddy; This caddy features 2 wide shelf baskets, 2 large hooks for washcloths and loofahs, 6 small hooks positioned to hold razors and shower accessories, and a no-slip grip at the top to keep the caddy secure in wet bathroom environments; The open grid design allows for maximum drainage and air circulation, items dry quickly, reducing the risk of mold and mildew; Use in shower stalls and bathtubs SMART DESIGN: This 2 tier shelf caddy organizer has space to store a wide variety of products in multiple shapes and sizes; Hooks for washcloths, back brushes, loofahs, poufs, razors, pumice stones and more; The baskets hold shampoo and conditioner bottles upside down for easy dispensing; The shelf is great for storing all your shower needs including large tall items: body wash, hand soap, shaving cream, oils, facial cleansers, leave-in conditioners, and salt scrubs EASY INSTALLATION: Simply hang over the showerhead, and it is ready to use; Designed to work with large, rain-style showerheads, just hang over the neck of your showerhead and use the suction cups to secure it to the wall; Two strong suction cups and no-slip grip at top keep the caddy secure; No hardware or drilling needed; Perfect for home, apartments, condos, dorms, RVs and campers; For home or commercial use QUALITY CONSTRUCTION: Made from sturdy steel wire with a durable rust-resistant finish; Plastic suction cups and hook grip; Suction cups adhere best to clean smooth, non-porous surfaces; Easily wipes clean with a damp cloth; Some assembly required - easy to follow instructions are included THOUGHTFULLY SIZED: Measures 4.55\" x 16.98\" x 22.64\" high","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51F7Ih0TTXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"mDesign","source_asin":"B0821QRT36","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-502645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0821QRT36","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0821QRT36","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":502646,"name":"NEATERIZE Extra Large Storage Bins - Set of 2 XL Storage Baskets for use as Closet Storage or Shelf Organizer - Extra Large Storage Bins with Handles ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91mYspga6nS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★ PERFECT BASKETS FOR ORGANIZING: Each storage baskets measures 17 x 13 x 13 inches making them great for holding crafting supplies, art supplies, large blankets or towels, pet supplies, memorabilia and much more. The more you use them, the more ideas you'll have for these versatile storage bins! Deep design makes them perfect for odd or tall items and each storage basket is stackable, freeing up valuable closet or shelf space where you need it most. Makes a great long term storage bin! ★ STORAGE BASKETS FOR SHELVES: NEATERIZE rings you a complete organization and storage system at a great value! For the price of one ordinary container, you'll get two extra-large sturdy storage bins with lids that are deep enough to hold nearly anything you can think of. Plus, they assemble quickly and are foldable, so you can stow each storage bin away when not in use. Each one features a label area for easy identification of its contents plus sturdy handles for greater portability. ★ MAKES A GREAT TOY BIN: Need a toy box for boys or girls? NEATERIZE storage baskets make perfect toy boxes for kids! Plus unlike traditional toy bins that your kids outgrow, these multi-purpose large storage boxes can be used for different things as your children grow. Use them for plush toys, action figures, dolls and more, as well as papers, artwork and other supplies. Many parents use these organizers and storage for sports uniforms and gear. ★ DURABLE STORAGE BOX - Stack these durable storage boxes and watch how much space you free up instantly! Great for tight spaces or unused areas like the bottom of the closet. They also make great shelf organizer baskets for the pantry, towel closet and more. Put one in the garage and you'll have an instant storage bin for motor oil, windshield cleaner and more. The possibilities are truly endless with the NEATERIZE organizers and storage system. ★ BUILT TO LAST: Unlike traditional storage bins, NEATERIZE boxes are built to last, with sturdy, durable stitching that goes together quickly and easily yet protects your items from dust build-up thanks to the included lids. Great for storing family heirlooms like quilts, dish sets and more. The more you use them, the more uses you'll discover for them, making these durable, sturdy boxes the ideal solution for all your organization and storage needs!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91mYspga6nS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEATERIZE","source_asin":"B098VYCBHZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-502646","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098VYCBHZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098VYCBHZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
