window.products.push({"id":502668,"name":"Mini Manual Food Chopper, An Extra Blade Durable Handheld Choppers and Dicers, Multifunction Food Processor, Fits for Chopping Vegetables/Fruits/Onion","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gZXpe+YRL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Smooth Journey Store is a company focused on the kitchen supplies, we providing customers with the best quality kitchen supplies, we always strive to add the extra convenience for your need, to enjoy your cooking and baking in the kitchen. - The package includes: 1*Mini Manual Food Chopper  1*Small Spoon  1*Instruction Manual  1*Replacement Blade： which is in the left of the package box - Simple to Use 1. Before use, please remove the plastic protective cover of the double-edged blade.  2. Operation method 1: close the lid tightly, tilt 45 degrees, operate with one hand, place it on the table and rotate it back and forth.  3. Operation method 2: Operate with both hands, hold the lid with one hand, and hold the bottom of the cup with the other hand to rotate back and forth  The best operation method is twist the mini food processor for 30 seconds, it will make the food in the bowl for mini size pieces. - Warmly Tips 1. Our products use gears to drive the blades to rotate, for larger food, you may have to cut the food into small pieces and put it in, or you will spend much strength to start. 2. If the gear is stuck, you can remove the cover and paint it with cooking oil, so that it will be easier for you next time. - Warning Attention: ① Store in a cool dry place out of the reach of children, the cutter is very sharp, do not let children touch it avoid scratching  ②To avoid injuries when cleaning, don’t touch the blades with fingers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gZXpe+YRL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FDFD","source_asin":"B08G8GY93N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-502668","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08G8GY93N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08G8GY93N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":502669,"name":"New Orleans, The Big Easy, French Quarter, Jackson Square, Souvenir Magnet 2 x 3 Photo Fridge Magnet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wdpAWJrXL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"ORI BOY Refrigerator Magnets are all Made in the USA. We offer hundreds of images on Magnets; Travel Magnets from all over the world including USA, Italy, England, Canada, Africa, South America, Vacation Islands and National Parks.  We have Religious Magnets like the Pope, different places of worship, famous Statues and landmarks. Movie and Entertainment Magnets from classic TV Shows and movies, Actors and Actresses to Singers. Art Magnets of famous paintings from history. Museum paintings presented to you on a 2\" x 3\" magnet. Animal magnet from Land, Sea and Air, we hope you enjoy our Bald Eagle, Wild Horses, Penguins and more. Political magnets of past and present. Presidents, Generals, Famous People that have changed our lives from History. Sports Stars like Babe Ruth along with fridge magnets of Ball Parks and Stadiums. Sayings, Humor, and more, some funny and other quotes that we remember all on magnets. Our magnets make a great collectible, look great on any locker or fridge. Have you every traveled somewhere and you forgot to buy a gift or remembrance. Our magnets are the same fridge magnets found in hotel gift shops, museums, airport shops, beach stores all over the world. So shop here and save time by buying them all in one place. We have thousands of images available covering as many topics as possible. Custom Magnets are also to order in Portrait or Landscape style in our Store. Create your custom magnet using our image upload and customize options.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wdpAWJrXL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"City to City Marketing","source_asin":"B0721P4KTP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-502669","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0721P4KTP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0721P4KTP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
