window.products.push({"id":502686,"name":"Yoassi Upgraded Tea Infusers for Loose Tea, Silicone Covered Extra Fine Mesh 18/8 Stainless Steel Tea Strainer with Large Capacity & Double Handles to","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kazUkYgEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Roomy Basket & Sturdy Lid. Yoassi loose leaf tea infuser has a bigger capacity that makes tea to circulate, instead of being cramped. Allows the full flavor to infuse tea. The lid keeps the steeping goodness from evaporating. Keeps water warm and No Mess. Extra Fine Holes keep even very fine-leaved tea in (such as Rooibos, Black tea, Herbal tea and Green teas), ideal tea strainers for loose tea. Tons of holes allow water to flow more freely. So the tea diffuses quickly. Nothing gets through this except for the water. Made of 8/18 Food Grade Stainless Steel. So this loose leaf tea steeper is odor free. Contains No harmful chemicals. Safer option to dip in hot water than using plastic ones. Keeps your drink free of odor and unwanted taste. Easy to clean and dishwasher safe. Two Handles. Perfect 5 inch Width & 3inch Height. Our tea diffuser can rest properly on the cup's edge. Fits most standard cups, mugs, teapots. Easy to put in and take out. Won’t fall into big mugs and won’t float like others. Worry-Free Purchase. We care about the customer's purchase satisfaction. If you have any questions while using tea infusers for loose tea, just feel free to contact us, we will surely offer you a satisfied solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kazUkYgEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yoassi","source_asin":"B09HL19Q8V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-502686","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HL19Q8V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HL19Q8V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":502687,"name":"Kuchengerate Adjustable Clear Kitchen Sink Dish Drying Grid Mat - 12.6\" Inch - Silicone Sink Protector - Cushions Sinks Stemware Wine Glasses Mugs Bow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GhXEj0ITL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✧ Adjustable Clear Kitchen Sink Dish Drying Grid Mat: 12.6\" Inch - Silicone Sink Protector - Cushions Sinks Stemware Wine Glasses Mugs Bowls Dishes - Quick Draining Contours to Sink. This silicone dish drying mat can hold your pots, pans and utensils. Eliminate the need for multiple dish mats ✧ Soft Protection: The sink protector grid protects kitchen, utility and laundry room sinks from scratches and damage; Soft support keeps all of your fine serving pieces, porcelain dishes, ceramic items, and glassware safe while washing; Multiple drain holes keep water flowing through to drain ✧ Stays in Place: The plastic mat grips the sink and stays in place, no more sliding and slipping; The adjustable corners allow this mat to be used in multiple sink sizes; The unique corner design allows the mat to lay flat in large sinks and curve upward in small sinks; The sink grid keeps dishes lifted off of sink surfaces so scratches and marring are a thing of the past; Use in homes, apartments, condos, dorms, RVs, campers and cabins ✧ Easy Cleaning - Fast Drying: Our dish drying adjustable mat has wide, raised ridges for ventilation that allow dishes to dry faster and water to evaporate quickly. Made from durable Silicone, it's so easy to clean! Top-rack dishwasher safe ✧ Use as a Dish Mat or Trivet: This Silicone Mat can also be used as a heat resistant Silicone Trivet capable of handling temperatures up to 450º degrees F. It can also be used as a fridge liner, garage storage mat, pet mat, or kitchen drawer liner ✧ Quick and Easy Storage: This Dish mat is made of soft, durable Silicone. The soft silicone material easily rolls and folds up for storage. Will easily fit tight spaces like kitchen drawers, small cabinets, campers, boats and rvs ✧ Quality Guarantee: We trust the quality of our product so much that we accept to replace it with a perfectly new one or we pay your money back!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GhXEj0ITL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Küchengeräte","source_asin":"B08H6YXMHF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-502687","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H6YXMHF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H6YXMHF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
