window.products.push({"id":502746,"name":"Wine Tapa Wine Glass Cover: Keep Bugs Out, Washable, Plastic, Outdoor, Drink Lid Marker for Glasses, Cans, Cups, Stemless Drinkware (Hot Pink)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KL02qVFQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Say goodbye to bugs in your wine. Imagine relaxing on a bright summer day, glass of wine or your favorite beverage in hand. Pure bliss until a bug lands right in your glass. You fish it out and grab a napkin to prevent it from happening again. But then the napkin gets blown off by wind and you're back to square one. Bugs and other particles in your drink are easily prevented with the use of the drink cover Wine Tapa. Wine Tapa is an outstanding, versatile wine glass cover. It's made of hard plastic, is a little over four inches in diameter and about a half-inch deep. This wine glass covers mesh opening is two inches in diameter, consisting of very dense stainless steel. Its underside contains an inch wide foam rubber gasket around the outer perimeter. The gasket is soft so that it won't chip the rim of the glass and is pliable so that it forms to the rim of the glass, creating a secure seal. The gasket material has enough grip to it that the Wine Tapa won't slide around atop the glass. Because the gasket is an inch wide, it can accommodate wine glasses whose rims are from two to four inches in diameter. Importantly, the mesh covered center opening on the wine cover allows the wine to continue to breathe and decant. This little drink cover for the bar is discreet, attractive and most of all functional. It works great for not only wine, but coffee, beer, soda, you name it. The wide variety of colors make it perfect for wine glass markers. Perfect for weddings, parties and other outdoor events. Impress your guests and never worry about getting bugs in your wine again. Drink cover set includes 1 Wine Tapa in different colors based on your selection above.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KL02qVFQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wine-Tapa","source_asin":"B00XAUEWEW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-502746","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XAUEWEW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XAUEWEW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
