window.products.push({"id":502779,"name":"HANGERWORLD Wedding Dress Storage Box Bridal Gown Preservation Kit including 10 sheets of Archival Acid Free Tissue Paper (Medium, Ivory)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zVfxwQ1pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"An elegant acid free storage boxes designed to be the perfect wedding dress preservation box. Ideal for evening gowns, a-line or slim bridal gowns and bridesmaid dresses, along with other keepsakes.This wedding dress box also includes 10 acid free tissue papers to wrap your luxury garments in, which helps to protect the delicate material of veils, silk and mesh of the dress inside the garment box. Great for keeping out moisture, dust and dirt. The pH neutral material will protect and store your memories to pass down to the next generation of your family.Travel to your wedding destination without worrying about your dress being damaged or squashed. The strong plastic frame of the box provides a protective shield for your dress. While it should still be handled with care (it will contain a precious wedding dress after all), the plastic clip fastenings will also prevent the lid from opening whilst traveling. Convenient sizing also means this box fits within airline hand luggage dimensions, Also great for tidying away out of seasonal clothing, jumpers, coats, quilts and blankets. This wedding dress box storage arrives flat packed. Simply open out and fit the base.It is easily folded back down when not in use. If the outside of the dress boxes get marked, simply wipe with a damp cloth.Supplied by trusted clothing care brand Hangerworld, high quality guaranteed so you can buy with confidence.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zVfxwQ1pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HANGERWORLD","source_asin":"B09FKCX9RB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-502779","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FKCX9RB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FKCX9RB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
