window.products.push({"id":502916,"name":"POUFIHARS Beach Towel, 35x71 inches Oversized Sandfree Beach Towel, Microfiber Beach Towels for Adults, Absorbent Dry Fast Lightweight Compact, Beach ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81toQeOcWqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Soft & Cozy: Microfiber can be used to make tough, very soft fabric. We use microfiber fabrics for the production of our beach towels as they can be lightweight, durable, and somewhat water-repellent. Unlike cotton, POUFIHARS microfiber beach towels won't grow hard after many uses and washes. Sand Prevention: Sand is the biggest enemy on the beach, it gets wet and sticks to the body, then go anywhere. High-density microfiber beach towels make good at preventing this from happening. They won't miss any crevices and won't leave any lint behind after the cleaning. Whether you spread it on the beach or on a beach chair, you only need to shake it lightly after getting up, and the sand will fall obediently without any effort. Oversized Size for More Space: POUFIHARS beach towel extra large as 71\" X 35\" to fit one adult. Perfectly for beach vacations, Hawaii honeymoons, swimming pool, air travel, and drive travel. The newfangled printed style will definitely work for your long-distance yet add more fun to boring travel. Absorbent, Dry Fast, Warming: When water is on your body, it takes heat away from you, that's why you always feel cold when you come out of the sea or pool. POUFIHARS super absorbent beach towels can absorb the sea water or pool water on your body in a short time, keeping you dry. Stay away from colds and fevers. Microfiber can also evaporate the water in a few mins. What the towel looks like before you take it out, and it will look like it when you get home. No One Does Better than POUFIHARS Ever: Coming home with a smelly and soggy beach towel is so lame! The grid-like packaging design, even a wet beach towel, can get rid of the seawater on the road. Moisture is able to escape well through the mesh without lingering in the bag and causing the beach towel to smell. 10.2x7.68x0.79 inches can even hold a book, a cell phone, or even a Bluetooth headphone case. Enjoy your own summer break!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81toQeOcWqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POUFIHARS","source_asin":"B0B45SWYRJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-502916","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B45SWYRJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B45SWYRJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
